From 0f819509d1d73d920acd8b26372189f821f34334 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mir Mohammad Sajedul Islam <mohammad.sajedul.islam@g.bracu.ac.bd>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:22:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): glowing colour-cycling icons and smoother
 phone/tablet experience

- Glowing icons change colour every 15 s from one shared timer that pauses in
  background tabs; floating icons fill the hero on phones and tablets
- 3D hero only on large screens and drops itself if it cannot hold ~40 fps
- Touch-friendly sliders, 44px tap targets, 16px inputs (no iOS zoom), safe areas
- Tablet layouts for the simulations; ball animation no longer re-renders React
- Lighter blur and effects on small screens; reduced-motion respected
